Total dedicated input used:	3/4 	(75%)
Total I/O pins used		55/80 	(68%)
Total Logic cells used 		93/128 	(72%)
Total Flip-Flop used 		52/128 	(40%)
Total Foldback logic used 	2/128 	(1%)
Total Nodes+FB/MCells 		95/128 	(74%)
Total cascade used 		0
Total input pins 		22
Total output pins 		36
Total Pts 			301
*/

